# Storefront Debug app launch

After each edit that affects the macOS app (UI, settings, Swift sources, etc.), rebuild and relaunch the Debug app without waiting to be asked.

When building and launching:

1. Quit any existing local Storefront instances first (`pkill -x Storefront`), so you are not testing a stale process.
2. Build, then `open` the Debug app.
3. Do NOT send Cmd+, or otherwise auto-open Settings — the user opens Settings themselves.
